we'll never catch up.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.670
You're really slow!
Out of the away!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.670
Maybe we are a little slow.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.750
We can relax a little, Aya-chan.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.760
Where did Akito-kun and her go?

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.640
Tsuyoshi-kun, they're over there.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.600
Are you two junior high school
students?

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.020
Looking good!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.810
Can you spare a few minutes?

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.190
Teen Net?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.980
It's a popular magazine.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.320
A lot of people are reading it.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.650
Really? I'm so honored.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.740
Then, can we take your pictures?

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.490
Why do you want our pictures?

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.990
You really are
ali... the... mo... ron.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:02.700
We have a column specially designed
for romantic couples on the street.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.790
Your girlfriend knows, right?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:08.340
Yeah, the column with pictures of
many couples.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.250
That's right.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.960
I took all the pictures.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.880
If we take your pictures...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.680
...you will receive this special
gift you can't find anywhere else.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.720
It's so cheap.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.060
You really want that thing?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.020
I really do.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.020
Maybe you
could get something even better.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.110
Since it's you guys,
I'm sure you can.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.150
Ok?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.320
- What do you think?
- I don't mind, it's just pictures.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.620
Then please stand in front of
the castle.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.580
Don't stand so far apart,
move closer.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.500
Put your arm around your
girlfriend's shoulder, like that.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.250
This time you stand
in front of him.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.750
This angle is perfect,
you look great.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.010
Wow! Now I can show this
to my friends.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.760
Wait until the publication date.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.340
Ok, let's go.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:04.060
Excuse me... could you take
a picture of us too?

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.600
You two?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.600
How much film is left?

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.900
One more.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.270
Are you ready?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.480
Yes, we're ready.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.160
Too bad, there's no more film left.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.950
- It can't be...
- Films are very expensive.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.170
You look very upset, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.750
Aya-chan...

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.960
I'm sorry, I'm so stupid.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.300
Don't worry about it.
Pull yourself together, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.930
But... it'll be very embarrassing
when the picture comes out.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.680
Don't worry, it won't be published.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:45.930
But I'm very happy today.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.480
- I want to say thank you.
- It was nothing.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.070
I wish we can be like this forever.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:57.030
It'll be great if we can be in
love like this forever.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.860
Is this still as sustaining
as you want?

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.990
What's going on? You have a
refreshing attitude recently, Akito.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:06.950
You always liked to put me down before.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:09.830
Even if I argue with you,
you'll always end up winning.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:14.460
I can never win against you
anyway, you're always right.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.880
I'm not always... right.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.510
You're right.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.470
I know.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.720
I didn't hear what they said back then...

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:32.100
...because I really wasn't in the mood to listen to other people's conversations.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.230
Eh?! It's published!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:41.950
No! People are going to see us
like this. This is so embarrassing!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:45.990
But, Aya-chan, if we don't tell
other people, no one will recognize us.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.200
That's a little disappointing...

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.500
Oh yeah.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.250
Where are Hayama-kun and
Fuka-chan's pictures?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.580
It didn't come out.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.960
That's weird.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:59.670
Our picture came out but
Akito-kun's didn't.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.060
This is bothersome. I wonder if
Akito is all right?

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.230
Once again.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.110
Hayama-kun's really the best...

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.610
Don't run in hallway!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.870
Yes sir.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.660
What's this?

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.750
T-That's...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.710
Hayama...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.380
Akito-kun's face is
always like this.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.670
Hayama-kun is so cute.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.590
Fuka-chan looks so happy.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.470
Even though it seems unfair,
I'll let you have the best couple award.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.640
What are you trying to say,
snot boy?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:55.060
Are you all right, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:59.320
Akito, things are getting more
serious.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:04.200
Yeah. Look, that's him,
he was on Teen Net.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.660
Really?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.160
I feel very uncomfortable.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.750
Akito...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.010
Faculty Room

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:22.090
I don't have any pleasant
memories of this place.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:25.630
Matsui looks great in this picture.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.510
That's not what I meant.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.560
Your student Hayama is actually smiling.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.310
Who cares about him?!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:36.020
Yeah... it's great to be young.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.360
You don't get it.{checar}

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:43.360
I have to borrow your student list.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.240
Hello, is this Matsui Fuka's
