00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.590
I want to tell you that...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.470
That's right... that's right...

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:12.930
You will have your next test soon.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.890
You all have to train harder!

